Add ONE module-level constant immediately after the `import { INDEX_CHECKPOINT_INTERVAL, SCAN_CHUNK_SIZE, MAX_LINE_BYTES } from '../constants.ts';` line (L21) and before `export interface LineIndexOpts`, separated by blank lines:

/**
 * build 的字符串外字节分类表：1 = 需交给状态机 switch 处理的字节
 * （'"' '{' '[' '}' ']' '\n' 以及空白 ' ' '\t' '\r'）；0 = 普通内容字节
 * （数字、true/false/null、':'、','、'\\' 等），它们在 switch 中只会落入 default
 * 并置 lineHasContent = true，故可整段跳过。
 */
const WCLS = new Uint8Array(256);
for (const c of [0x22, 0x7b, 0x5b, 0x7d, 0x5d, 0x0a, 0x20, 0x09, 0x0d]) {
  WCLS[c] = 1;
}

Exactly these nine byte values and no others. Do not export it, do not add any other table, helper, DataView, Uint32Array, or state variable.

Inside `static async build`, in the per-chunk `while (i < n) {` loop, insert the following block between the closing `}` of the `if (inString) { ... continue; }` branch (L281-282, `continue;` / `}`) and the existing line `const b = buf[i];` (L283). Nothing else in the loop changes:

        // 字符串外普通内容字节整段跳过：它们在 switch 中只会置 lineHasContent
        if (WCLS[buf[i]] === 0) {
          lineHasContent = true;
          do {
            i++;
          } while (i < n && WCLS[buf[i]] === 0);
          if (i >= n) break;
        }

Requirements: (a) the block is at the top level of the `while (i < n)` body, NOT inside the switch or the string `for (;;)`, so `break` exits the per-chunk while loop exactly as reaching `i === n` would and control continues at `totalBytes += n;`; (b) after the block, when i < n, buf[i] is guaranteed WCLS 1 and falls through to the unchanged `const b = buf[i]; switch (b) { ... } i++;`; (c) the string branch L247-282 (escaped carry, 4x '> 0x5c' reject, byte tail), the entire switch including its default case `if (b !== 0x20 && b !== 0x09 && b !== 0x0d) lineHasContent = true;`, the trailing `i++`, and all Chinese comments stay byte-for-byte identical; (d) use braces on the do/while body (oxlint/prettier style); do not rewrite the default case, do not reorder switch cases, do not add a quote-first check, nextCp counter, SWAR/Uint32Array string scanner, lazy/typed record storage, or chunk-iteration changes.
